      "latin": "Cedo palmam!",
      "status": "recommended",
      "period": "ours",
      "gloss": "give me five! (holding up a hand to be slapped)",
      "comment": "No ancient form is known: the high five is modern. Ours, on the model of Plautus’s <span lang=\"la\">Cedo manum</span>, give me your hand (<em>Capt.</em> 838, 859; see give it here), with <span lang=\"la\">palma</span>, the flat of the hand (Cic., Verg.)."
    }
